{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><div id=\"upper\"><p style='-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(43, 47, 51);font-family:lato, Arial, PingFangTC, \"Microsoft JhengHei revise\", \"Microsoft JhengHei\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", sans-serif;font-size:16.0016px;font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;line-height:1.67;margin:0px !important 0px 0px;orphans:2;text-align:justify;text-decoration-color:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;'>教育大學今日（27日）「正名」十周年，由教院變教大，管理層拍片賀「大學發展里程碑」，教大校董會主席黃友嘉表示「正名十周年」體現大學多年來在教研、知識轉移及國際化持續邁進；又指教大未來會積極融入大灣區發展，「與國家發展方向同頻共振，為鞏固香港作為國際教育樞紐的地位作出更大貢獻。」</p><p style='-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(43, 47, 51);font-family:lato, Arial, PingFangTC, \"Microsoft JhengHei revise\", \"Microsoft JhengHei\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", sans-serif;font-size:16.0016px;font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;line-height:1.67;margin:0px;orphans:2;text-align:justify;text-decoration-color:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;'>教大校長李子建表示，過去十年，教大由秉持「教育為本，超越教育」理念，進一步邁向「教育未來  多元專才」願景，在課程發展、研究創新、知識轉移及國際化方面不斷突破。他稱未來將持續透過「世界級的教育」並配合國家教育、科技、人才一體化的發展策略，「為本地、國家乃至全球社會作出貢獻。」</p><p style='-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(43, 47, 51);font-family:lato, Arial, PingFangTC, \"Microsoft JhengHei revise\", \"Microsoft JhengHei\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", sans-serif;font-size:16.0016px;font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;line-height:1.67;margin:0px;orphans:2;text-align:justify;text-decoration-color:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;'> </p><p style='-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(43, 47, 51);font-family:lato, Arial, PingFangTC, \"Microsoft JhengHei revise\", \"Microsoft JhengHei\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", sans-serif;font-size:16.0016px;font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;line-height:1.67;margin:0px;orphans:2;text-align:justify;text-decoration-color:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;'>13教育學士全變雙學位</p><p style='-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(43, 47, 51);font-family:lato, Arial, PingFangTC, \"Microsoft JhengHei revise\", \"Microsoft JhengHei\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", sans-serif;font-size:16.0016px;font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;line-height:1.67;margin:0px;orphans:2;text-align:justify;text-decoration-color:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;'> </p><p style='-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(43, 47, 51);font-family:lato, Arial, PingFangTC, \"Microsoft JhengHei revise\", \"Microsoft JhengHei\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", sans-serif;font-size:16.0016px;font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;line-height:1.67;margin:0px;orphans:2;text-align:justify;text-decoration-color:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;'>教大今午發稿介紹大學發展，稱過去十年持續推進學術多元化，課程範疇由教育延伸至心理學、數據科學、社會學、運動科學、新媒體、個人理財等領域；現時提供109個本科及研究生課程，全數13個教育學士課程亦已全面轉為雙學位，「為學生提供更廣闊的跨學科學習機會」。至於學生規模，教大過去十年學生人數增長近45%，現已超過16,000人，並累計培育逾52,000個教育工作者及不同專業人才。</p><p style='-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(43, 47, 51);font-family:lato, Arial, PingFangTC, \"Microsoft JhengHei revise\", \"Microsoft JhengHei\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", sans-serif;font-size:16.0016px;font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;line-height:1.67;margin:0px;orphans:2;text-align:justify;text-decoration-color:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;'><br/>校方續指，近年持續拓展教育科技以外的新興研究領域，涵蓋神經心理學、健康科技、言語治療及職業治療等，推動多項惠及社會的創新成果；自2018年起，教大研究人員於多個重要國際發明展中共獲234個獎項；又形容「知識轉移發展亦成績顯著」，去年收入按年升近3倍增至8億元，並獲批超過170個政府資助研究項目及孵化培育107支初創團隊。</p></div>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-05-27T16:18:54.018102+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":640,"images":0,"source":"明報 本地","fallback":"unknown"}}